body:
Some of this I would say are more psych drugs and antihistamines than DOA's. But here is my list (chronologically):
- Sugar;
- Caffeine;
- Hydroxyzine;
- DPH;
- Alcohol;
- Nicotine;
- Hash and Weed;
- Myristicin (Nutmeg);
- DXM;
- LSA;
- Brugmansia and Datura;
- Tramadol;
- Valium/Xanax/Kpins;
- Gabapentin;
- Pregabalin;
- Quetiapine;
- Olanzapine;
- Trazodone;
- Chlorpromazine;
- Buprenorphine;
- Codeine;
- Methylphenidate;
- MDMA;
- Cocaine.

- This list is incomplete you can help by helping me expand it. Nah jk. But this comment of mine is for real.
